	(text "5V entry: barrel (bench) or JAMMA (cab) via JP400. Never both.\n12V only feeds the (DNP) speaker amp via pi-filter fc=1/(2*pi*sqrt(10uH*220uF))=3.4kHz, damped by electrolytic ESR.\nCHASSIS-GND: 1M || 10nF hybrid + JP402 hard bond (close at ONE point only; open when JAMMA PSU already bonds earth)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "40836af1-02f3-4330-bcfd-1675a0169f69")
	)
	(text "Standard-ESR electrolytics on purpose: ESR damps the LC (Z0=0.21R, zeta=ESR/2Z0)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133.74 153.89 0)
		(effects
